    "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the CAD Designer: assembling profile frames, adjusting components, generating the bill of materials, and optimizing cuts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the CAD Designer: assembling profile frames, adjusting components, generating the bill of materials, and optimizing cuts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本手册介绍 CAD 设计的界面与基本操作:拼装型材框架、调整组件、生成物料清单以及切割优化。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本手冊介紹 CAD 設計的介面與基本操作:組裝型材框架、調整組件、產生物料清單以及切割最佳化。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本手冊介紹 CAD 設計的介面與基本操作:組裝型材框架、調整組件、產生物料清單以及切割最佳化。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本手冊介紹 CAD 設計的介面與基本操作:組裝型材框架、調整組件、產生物料清單以及切割最佳化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
